Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 01:56:22 -0700
Subject: Fix catch prediction check in Promise.race

When the debugger is active, Promise.race marks rejections by setting kPromiseHandledBySymbol on thenResult. The condition incorrectly verified that promise was a JSPromise rather than checking thenResult. (Compare to promise-any.tq or promise-all.tq.)

(cherry picked from commit 74b6f1e09576864c1a367891a21bc4cd5251f626)

Fixed: 562325084
Bug: 560121552
